                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your patient, a 79-year-old male, who presented on 01/09/1955 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever, clinically consistent with acute appendicitis. Diagnostic workup including blood tests, abdominal ultrasound, and physical examination confirmed the diagnosis. Given his age and the acute presentation, he was optimized for surgery and subsequently underwent a laparoscopic appendectomy without intraoperative complications. Postoperatively, he received intravenous fluid replacement, analgesic medication, and wound care. Recovery was uneventful. Vital signs remained stable throughout the stay. He was mobilized with physiotherapy support and discharged home on 05/09/1955 in good general condition. Please arrange follow-up in approximately two weeks for wound inspection and general assessment. Do not hesitate to contact me should any questions arise.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
